  "prefLabel": "En 1502.22 Overlash communication line crossing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1502.22 \"Overlash communication line crossing\" means a crossing not involving the construction or modification of any utility line other than the construction or modification of a communication line by means of overlash on an existing, licensed crossing.\n\nSource. #13939, eff 4-26-24",
